    c2: "C2 · Pre-intervention diagnosis",
    equipment: "45 m3 · Chlorine treatment · Pentair 0.75 kW pump · Ondilo ICO sensor · Last sync 09:14",
    phRisk: "Irritation + corrosion risk",
    chlorineRisk: "Algae risk",
    diagnosis: "Bluu3 AI diagnosis: bring 300g pH+, 200g 56% granular shock chlorine, 100ml preventive algaecide. Estimated duration: 35 minutes. High priority before Wednesday, May 21.",
